DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The hhiill interface provides access to the “Human Interface Loop” con‐
     troller found on many HP workstations.

     It provides generic HIL management and interfaces for child devices, such
     as keyboards, button boxes, mice, graphics tablet, and ID modules.

     OpenBSD provides support for the following devices:

        hilid(4)     HIL ID module device
        hilkbd(4)    HIL keyboard device
        hilms(4)     HIL mouse and graphics tablet device

